        "message": "Hi Sir/Ma'am,\n\nI hope you're doing well.\n\nMy name is Pratyush Sahoo, and I'm a Data Engineer with 2+ years of experience building scalable data platforms using Spark, PySpark, and Azure (ADF, Databricks).\n\nIn my current role, I work on high-volume financial systems processing 4–5M+ records per day, where I've developed metadata-driven ETL/ELT pipelines and improved Delta Lake performance by ~80%.\n\nI'm keen on solving large-scale data engineering problems and would appreciate it if you could consider my profile for any current or upcoming Data Engineering opportunities within your organization.\n\nPlease find my resume here:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/17LIs1fmbDUHGa6x1PsfApECY1RQ8y_uS/view?usp=sharing\n\nFeel free to reach out at pratyush.sahoo2k26@gmail.com\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nPratyush Sahoo",
